 "frontmatter": {
  "title": "June 2025 - radix-ui Migration",
  "description": "A new command to migrate to the new radix-ui package.",
  "date": "2025-06-11T00:00:00.000Z"
 },
 "toc": [],
 "hast": "\n<p>We've added a new command to migrate to the new <code>radix-ui</code> package. This command will replace all <code>@radix-ui/react-*</code> imports with <code>radix-ui</code>.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest migrate radix\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest migrate radix\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest migrate radix\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest migrate radix\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest migrate radix\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> migrate</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> radix</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>It will automatically update all imports in your <code>ui</code> components and install <code>radix-ui</code> as a dependency.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"diff\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components/ui/alert-dialog.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"diff\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"- import * as AlertDialogPrimitive from &#x22;@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog&#x22;\n+ import { AlertDialog as AlertDialogPrimitive } from &#x22;radix-ui&#x22;\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"diff\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FF8080;--shiki-light:#82071E\">- import * as AlertDialogPrimitive from \"@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#116329\">+ import { AlertDialog as AlertDialogPrimitive } from \"radix-ui\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Make sure to test your components and project after running the command.</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> To update imports for newly added components, run the migration command again.</p>"
}
